==English==
{{wikipedia|Tea party (social_gathering)|Tea party}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[tea]] [[party]]|tea parties}}

# A semi-formal [[afternoon]] [[social]] [[gathering]] at which [[tea]], [[sandwich]]es and [[cake]]s are served.
# A [[small]] [[gathering]] of [[children]] or their toys, who mimic having a real dinner, often without any food at all.

